t made my day 😁👍🏻", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCxaWE6trMZbyeh0nGaRvAcA", "author": "@Vortez", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nk-WSNzg_zqx4N1-V0vIanjRAUHv5K7QAdbEvkvr3Xtdg=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@Vortez", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzsMdatuLXXmH2vqL14AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "Hey man, nice coverage of also including a teardown. Always curious of PCB and heatsink designs.", "like_count": 11, "author_id": "UCL8S71ua6flKdtt3HGJAUYQ", "author": "@ceasarentila1539", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lZwm-tl9ifI0yl3GNgYWG9cCkUKv1TutKct6GDEbaiJzI=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ceasarentila1539", "is_favorited": true, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "get 5500xt 8gb or 590 @ $179. 1600 series is worst value.", "like_count": 2, "author_id": "UCegBLOLgZj1bsQqy3VnVlKA", "author": "@lb5928", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lh7sRYM3Yn5b6S87otsS7IUk9S1Jf-hBNIg-41KvA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@lb5928", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg.92WSxMKzTIC92Xs9skbQW3", "parent": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg", "text": "@AustinSBL306 1650 super is limited by 4GB limit with ultra settings it is %15 slower than 5500xt 8gb/ RX590. At $179 an undervolted RX 590 is a much better choice.", "like_count": 1, "author_id": "UCegBLOLgZj1bsQqy3VnVlKA", "author": "@lb5928", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lh7sRYM3Yn5b6S87otsS7IUk9S1Jf-hBNIg-41KvA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@lb5928", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg.92WSxMKzTIC92Xsgn-swz9", "parent": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg", "text": "@AustinSBL306 At $179 now on newegg the RX590 matches the 1660 in performance for $50 less. Also undervolting the RX590 saves ~60watts! RX590 is still the king of 1080p.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCegBLOLgZj1bsQqy3VnVlKA", "author": "@lb5928", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lh7sRYM3Yn5b6S87otsS7IUk9S1Jf-hBNIg-41KvA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@lb5928", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg.92WSxMKzTIC92XxJV6_Y-U", "parent": "UgzIQO6A90tzYRs9qMp4AaABAg", "text": "@AustinSBL306 LOL, 😂. I see how nvidia shills are tricked out of their money. The 1650 Super and 1660 are DOA.  the cheaper 580 and 590 are clearly the better buy. The RX590 performs like a 1660 for $30 to $50 less. Here is one for $179: https://www.newegg.com/gigabyte-radeon-rx-590-gv-rx590gaming-8gd-rev-2-0/p/N82E16814932222\n\nPeople critisize the wattage of those cards. A minor undervolt reduces wattage by nearly 60watts no performance loss.", "like_count": 1, "author_id": "UCegBLOLgZj1bsQqy3VnVlKA", "author": "@lb5928", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lh7sRYM3Yn5b6S87otsS7IUk9S1Jf-hBNIg-41KvA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@lb5928", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgzAEJKgjXTLiq2j4Kl4AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "Great job vortex", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC7VrGwr4QkVeWvOWhRX2Lnw", "author": "@ilovegame5914", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/9pnc53Mpbex-RCuy--Ke2x4iMYlJlBV_KiE_WzOaiooFpQRMRwN_ysmDQLGr4sAUdAm_1ckn=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ilovegame5914", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxGMAr-uQybMRXbQx54AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "at 220 usd , should i get an gtx 1660, RX 5500 or any other alternative?\n\nPS.: I'm not from US and dont know how market price is, just saw it on amazon", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCwt8PGhTJe_9PFG7_cXqiXw", "author": "@Willian774", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/xDXKTNIkilXKM8VvNS7SunsjFweL9EEH7w5KTQojvV7_rtiyvwa1Zikjd-n_hR4aFM0ptyyRQyw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@Willian774", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxGMAr-uQybMRXbQx54AaABAg.92Vf-qr49iw92_QWzLvcpl", "parent": "UgxGMAr-uQybMRXbQx54AaABAg", "text": "If it's exactly the same price then I would be tempted to go with the 1660 especially if it's a model with factory overclock", "like_count": 2, "author_id": "UCxaWE6trMZbyeh0nGaRvAcA", "author": "@Vortez", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nk-WSNzg_zqx4N1-V0vIanjRAUHv5K7QAdbEvkvr3Xtdg=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": true, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@Vortez", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "5 years ago", "timestamp": 1604448000, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgxGMAr-uQybMRXbQx54AaABAg.92Vf-qr49iw92_UdXoVovN", "parent": "UgxGMAr-uQybMRXbQx54AaABAg", "text": " @Vortez  Yeah, after some comparisons, i've made my mind.. Thanks!", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCwt8PGhTJe_9PFG7_cXqiXw", "au